Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:28.29,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}曾認為如此單調的灰藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.29,0:22:31.33,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}便是這人生的色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:35.92,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}但未知的彩虹卻滿溢出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:41.42,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}從我笨拙的言語漫延
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:44.43,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}那份心意深藏心底
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:48.05,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}「回看過去也沒關係」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.05,0:22:51.93,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}教會我的也是你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.93,0:22:55.19,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}平淡無奇的日常裡
