Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:10.66,ED-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(60,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFPOP1W5-B5\frz-90\1a&H00&}心暖熾熱想要銘記當下
